    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Talk to us</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278290/extras/dd51ca6c7fe3741c056abaf6ce42f416.poster.avif?t=1644674676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278290/extras/dd51ca6c7fe3741c056abaf6ce42f416.webm?t=1644674676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278290/extras/dd51ca6c7fe3741c056abaf6ce42f416.mp4?t=1644674676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278290/extras/f518bd70890ad4a78c1f3ce48b1e3c5f.avif?t=1644674676\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Up to 4 Players Local Coop<br></li><li> Over 80 handcrafted levels<br></li><li>Single Player Mode<br></li><li>Online Leaderboards<br></li><li>Full Controller Support (mix and match XBox One, Xbox 360, PS4, and other)<br></li><li>Simple Controls (2-&quot;Button&quot;-Game)<br></li><li>No Story Twaddle</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sit Back and Grab Your Gamepads</h2>xDasher is a frantic local coop game about dashing through monsters with the proper colour to get higher combos and scores. This is a game where co-op actually means cooperative, because all players share a health bar and any monster encounter requires every one to do their part. <br><br>The gameplay is entirely colour coded, meaning each of your team mates can only damage monsters highlighted in their colour. You need to attack monsters alternatingly and within a small time frame to kill them. Thus, xDasher evokes old-school couch co-op feelings, where you start yelling at each other, given the fierce battle against time, the hustle of aligning your tactics and knowing you will only make it as a team.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Levels</h2>Each stage is hand crafted and each run consists of a number of randomly picked stages. The demo includes a tutorial and three levels. In the full game there are additional boss battles which put your team to the ultimate test.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Online Leaderboards</h2>In the spirit of arcade competition, your team also fight for the highest score on an online leaderboard. <br><br>As a team, you increase the score by killing monsters and advancing through the dungeon. Furthermore, each of your team mates can earn special awards to show off their prowess.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Credits</h2>Trailermusic Composed By Jens kiilstofte",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278290/extras/dd51ca6c7fe3741c056abaf6ce42f416.poster.avif?t=1644674676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278290/extras/dd51ca6c7fe3741c056abaf6ce42f416.webm?t=1644674676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278290/extras/dd51ca6c7fe3741c056abaf6ce42f416.mp4?t=1644674676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278290/extras/f518bd70890ad4a78c1f3ce48b1e3c5f.avif?t=1644674676\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Up to 4 Players Local Coop<br></li><li> Over 80 handcrafted levels<br></li><li>Single Player Mode<br></li><li>Online Leaderboards<br></li><li>Full Controller Support (mix and match XBox One, Xbox 360, PS4, and other)<br></li><li>Simple Controls (2-&quot;Button&quot;-Game)<br></li><li>No Story Twaddle</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sit Back and Grab Your Gamepads</h2>xDasher is a frantic local coop game about dashing through monsters with the proper colour to get higher combos and scores. This is a game where co-op actually means cooperative, because all players share a health bar and any monster encounter requires every one to do their part. <br><br>The gameplay is entirely colour coded, meaning each of your team mates can only damage monsters highlighted in their colour. You need to attack monsters alternatingly and within a small time frame to kill them. Thus, xDasher evokes old-school couch co-op feelings, where you start yelling at each other, given the fierce battle against time, the hustle of aligning your tactics and knowing you will only make it as a team.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Levels</h2>Each stage is hand crafted and each run consists of a number of randomly picked stages. The demo includes a tutorial and three levels. In the full game there are additional boss battles which put your team to the ultimate test.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Online Leaderboards</h2>In the spirit of arcade competition, your team also fight for the highest score on an online leaderboard. <br><br>As a team, you increase the score by killing monsters and advancing through the dungeon. Furthermore, each of your team mates can earn special awards to show off their prowess.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Credits</h2>Trailermusic Composed By Jens kiilstofte",
    "short_description": "A couch coop game where 1-4 players set off into a dim dungeon. Your quest is to eliminate all monsters lurking within by dashing through the monsters with the proper color. Eventually, you will be haunted by a ghoulish, four-headed beast and must face it in a thrilling boss fight.",
